elax in a setting that feels like a year-round vacation. Entertain friends who will be amazed by this unique lifestyle! Rent includes a private boat slip for a powerboat up to 23.5 ft and one parking space. Rarely available and truly unforgettable-step onto the dock and you'll instantly feel at home. (id:67604)"},"29965446":{"remarks":". (id:67604)"},"30223110":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639238930660200000/reb89/highres/9/R3160689_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listi