 impeccably planned layout. Situated in the core of downtown Vancouver, you are mere steps from Coal Harbour, the Waterfront, premier dining, and the Financial District. Complete with 24-hour concierge service and signature automated valet parking. (id:67604)"},"30501078":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299338703830000/reb89/highres/9/R3183109_16.jpg"],"remarks":"Beautiful ocean views and privacy on 2.47 acres in Gibsons! This charming 972 sq. ft. home offers 2 bedrooms plus den, 2 full bathrooms and a spacious sundeck overlooking Keats Island. Enjoy a peaceful, private setting just minutes from Lower Gibsons, shopping, restaurants, trails and the